The '''Farmhand''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{zone|The Barn}}. They give the player a quest to craft a {{Item|Wheat Minion}} followed by collecting various items for them from around the area.

== Quest ==
The '''Farmhand''' grants the player the {{Item|Wheat Minion}} recipe when first speaking to him. Upon presenting him with a {{Item|Wheat Minion I}}, they reward the player with a {{Item|Chicken Pet}}, and teach them how to use it. Afterwards, the player is tasked with collecting other resources on {{Zone|The Barn}}, with the Farmhand rewarding {{Skill XP|10 Farming}} upon completion. After reaching {{Skill|Farming 5}}, the player is rewarded with {{SkyBlock XP|+5}} and {{Skill XP|300 Farming}}.

